// Template for local signing config.
//
//   cp Config.xcconfig.example Config.xcconfig
//
// DEVELOPMENT_TEAM is the 10-character Team ID from Xcode → Settings → Accounts
// → your Apple ID → Manage Certificates, or from developer.apple.com →
// Membership. It is machine-specific, which is why it lives here rather than in
// the Xcode project, and why Config.xcconfig is gitignored.
//
// A personal (free) Apple ID works.
DEVELOPMENT_TEAM = YOUR_TEAM_ID
